  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity To support the Lebanon Ministry of Education to develop their plans for Reaching All Children with Education  Phase II (RACE II) for the period 2016-2021  is a component of Support to Lebanon&#x2019;s Reaching All Children with Education plan (RACE II) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;635,500. It works in the following sector(s): Education policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
